# React Native + Expo

## Theme

Import `@/theme` tokens. Load Plus Jakarta Sans + Be Vietnam Pro via `expo-font`.

## Stitch Component Patterns

- `PrimaryButton`: 4px 3D offset, translate down on press
- `MoveInput`: 56px, 2pt stroke, `radius.lg` (16px)
- `Card`: white, 2pt `colors.cardStroke`, 4px bottom offset — no drop shadow
- `ChessBoard`: fluid width minus 40px margins; a–h / 1–8 labels; SVG pieces
- Icons: `components/ui/icons/` — SVG only, **no emoji**

## Performance

Reanimated for press animations. Stockfish WASM + STT off main thread.

## Routes

```
app/                    → Expo Router entry
  (onboarding)/         → linear flow, gestureEnabled: false
  (main)/               → tabs: Home | Training | Match | Settings
screens/onboarding/     → HookBoard, StoryCheck, RewardPuzzle, FogReveal, MatchPrimer
screens/home/           → HomeDashboard (closed-loop)
```

## Structure

```
screens/       → compose components, route params, thin orchestration
components/ui/ → reusable primitives (check here first)
components/*   → domain modules (chess, match, heatmap, replay, home, onboarding)
hooks/         → shared stateful logic
stores/        → Zustand + AsyncStorage (guest session)
```

Reuse before creating. Extract when a block repeats across screens/states or a screen grows unwieldy. Do not over-abstract one-off UI.

## State

chess.js owns position. UI state in Zustand. Server state via TanStack Query.

## Blueprint

No board pieces during blindfold (except hook/replay/post-game). No voice in training.

## Testing (iOS Simulator MCP)

After UI changes: unit tests → `npx expo start --ios` → `ios-simulator-testing` skill.

Add `accessibilityLabel` on all new interactives. Bundle: `com.mindboard.app`.

## Doc Maintenance

Route or structure changes → update `AGENTS.md` + this file's Routes section. See `doc-maintenance` rule.
